    precondition: "Team is active, requester is its sole Orchestrator, recipient is an active Specialist, and human-authorized scope permits the work",
    purpose: "Authorize one bounded Assignment without allowing an Orchestrator or Specialist to elevate authority or create a second parent hierarchy",
    settlement: "Assignment has durable identity, purpose, selected input context, authority limits, acceptance criteria, return contract and queued/running state tied to a genuine Cognate run",
    steps: "Orchestrator specifies assignment and recipient -> boundary validates Team membership and allowlist intersection -> assignment is persisted before execution -> serialized dispatcher starts the Specialist run with captured route and correlation",
    variants: "typed abstention/decline leaves a reasoned terminal assignment; duplicate request reuses same logical assignment; concurrency waits in durable queue; provider failure is recoverable"
}

